// Template for MealPrep/Configs/Secrets.xcconfig
//
// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig in the same folder and paste your key.
// Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored; this template is not.
//
//   cp MealPrep/Configs/Secrets.example.xcconfig MealPrep/Configs/Secrets.xcconfig
//
// IMPORTANT: do NOT wrap the value in quotes. .xcconfig treats quotes as part
// of the value, so `OPEN_AI_API_KEY = "sk-..."` sends the quote characters to
// OpenAI and every request fails with a 401 that looks like a bad key.
//
// Correct:   OPEN_AI_API_KEY = sk-proj-abc123
// Incorrect: OPEN_AI_API_KEY = "sk-proj-abc123"
//
// Also note that // starts a comment in .xcconfig. Keys do not contain //,
// but be aware if you ever put a URL in this file.

OPEN_AI_API_KEY =
